#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Patch the Antigravity CLI (`agy`) for 1M-class context windows.

The tool rewrites a fixed, version-checked set of code sites in the Go
binary (Linux x86-64): it disables automatic checkpointing/compaction,
removes the 256k token clamp, raises the built-in context-window values to
the fixed UI maximum (983040 tokens) and makes the model picker offer
context-window options for every model.

It never edits settings files and never uses the network.  All edits are
exact same-length byte replacements inside named Go functions located via
the Go pclntab and the moduledata relocations of the ELF image.  Unknown or
ambiguous binaries abort before anything is written.

Tested against agy 1.5.8 and 1.5.7 (the 1.5.7 tables exist for rollback).
"""

import argparse
import hashlib
import json
import mmap
